  "title": "An Editor+ stored cross-site scripting (XSS) issue in the personal data erasure requests screen",
  "summary": "A user with the Editor role or above can create a personal data erasure request through XML-RPC whose email field contains a script, which runs when an Administrator views the Erase Personal Data screen.\r\n\r\nWordPress 7.1.4 has been released containing a fix for the vulnerability, and as a courtesy to users on older branches the fix has been backported to all branches back to 4.9.\r\n\r\nDiscovered and responsibly disclosed by Anthropic.",
